{"name": "Monster Fantasy", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/7a25b31705a73109906a9e31ec03b7f4.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/7a25b31705a73109906a9e31ec03b7f4.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/7a25b31705a73109906a9e31ec03b7f4.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/03092c2003de9b51a3887186264e1b98.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"646\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an amnesiac hero in the Kingdom of Eldoras, you can follow the classic path of an adventurer\u2014hunting monsters to earn materials and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/992ca6950095208f5a2bb96fa9dd0bcf.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/992ca6950095208f5a2bb96fa9dd0bcf.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/992ca6950095208f5a2bb96fa9dd0bcf.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or spend your days fishing, chopping wood, mining, cooking, crafting your own equipment, and enjoying a variety of life-sim activities. Play freely, your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/2a70e238f107e6dd72659fcbb35c2fc6.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/2a70e238f107e6dd72659fcbb35c2fc6.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/2a70e238f107e6dd72659fcbb35c2fc6.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin a life of your own in a world where legends meet everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/84007197c009e8303956166ea9d71c63.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/84007197c009e8303956166ea9d71c63.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/84007197c009e8303956166ea9d71c63.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/f789278a878c066cad1e647745789ebe.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"772\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Around 50 giant monsters await your challenge. Each monster has its own unique behavior, and learning their traits will help you claim victory more easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/c7014b3e50d6275f2969d5c521b4c738.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/c7014b3e50d6275f2969d5c521b4c738.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/c7014b3e50d6275f2969d5c521b4c738.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 4 different classes: Warrior, Mage, Archer, and Martial Artist. Each class features its own unique combat mechanics. Will you develop them all, or specialize in your favorite? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/df23e18e19ba2f78501915d07bb9fe6b.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/df23e18e19ba2f78501915d07bb9fe6b.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/df23e18e19ba2f78501915d07bb9fe6b.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/0c21f6f5816d1db8cc68d3ad9bc19908.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"772\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start a new life in a beautiful village! Around 100 villagers are waiting to meet you, each with their own personality, strengths, and interests. Build friendships with them and work together to create a wonderful home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras_big/cd89a0132b26a7123fd591256207fafd.webp?t=1789470575\" height=\"804\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/cd89a0132b26a7123fd591256207fafd.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/6fc1add94d472ebdfc7785af534f6e82.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"646\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can tame defeated monsters as pets and help them grow and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/418590e9b6af6051bfc950c0aafef733.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/418590e9b6af6051bfc950c0aafef733.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/418590e9b6af6051bfc950c0aafef733.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride your monsters across valleys, rainforests, icy plains, volcanoes, and more as you explore every corner of the vast kingdom\u2014and fight alongside them in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/65ac65cf73e38613bf20bd6bf2e0e05a.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/65ac65cf73e38613bf20bd6bf2e0e05a.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/65ac65cf73e38613bf20bd6bf2e0e05a.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"65\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/489796694ddec81eb869075d82101523.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"646\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game supports online multiplayer. Team up with your friends to hunt monsters, build your village, and set out on an adventure together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/3d15d575240ab2a825e557d41b58c516.poster.avif?t=1789470575\" width=\"598\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/3d15d575240ab2a825e557d41b58c516.webm?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/extras/3d15d575240ab2a825e557d41b58c516.mp4?t=1789470575\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hunt giant monsters and build a beautiful home! Monster Fantasy is an action RPG with cozy life-sim elements. As an amnesiac hero, explore Eldoras, battle monsters with companions, befriend villagers, and enjoy fishing, cooking, gathering, and crafting.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713940/3ec6635b9b7bb0006de8e51fbe8784e5b994932b/header.jpg?t=1789470575", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Hunting", "Creature Collector", "Life Sim", "Online Co-Op", "Action-Adventure", "Character Customization"], "developers": "Jotoyo", "publishers": "Jotoyo", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4713940", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "15 September 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/I-T2EObiG20", "first_seen": 1789423200.0, "review_rank": 36}